Description: Remnawave Node
 Rust agent for the Remnawave Panel. It supervises the Xray Core process and
 exposes the Panel-compatible HTTPS and internal APIs.
 .
 The package bundles the Xray Core binary, geodata, the ASN prefix database and
 the geocheck helper.
